start
:Identify authorized application and user-reported submission context;
:Identify resume and cover letter actually submitted;
if (Required material / provenance conditions satisfied?) then (yes)
 :Capture the defined actual submitted set;
 if (Required preservation completed?) then (yes)
  :Identify preserved material separately from editable source; <<#173B34>>
